  - guid: 15302017-c624-46a8-bbfa-a8ba1cfd643f
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Look at all these cowards roaming the market.
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: a491e76e-f7ab-4f7c-8a0d-d81b788b7445
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: The Flux comes knocking a few times and they all scramble to leave everything behind.
      delaySeconds: 2.6
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: 95a17bc9-b650-4812-b253-3e507bd1c687
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Taking all their fancy beef with them, leaving only us real ones behind.
      delaySeconds: 4
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: ec434a05-2d8a-4cf5-8258-680ddc51858f
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Pathetic...
      delaySeconds: 3.6
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: fc745658-f018-418a-9dbe-3319ecef50d8
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: For real, though. You can barely scrape together some beef these days.
      delaySeconds: 1.4
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: 9557a201-052d-4d96-a683-190ebc7edd88
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Not like I'd want to anyway...
      delaySeconds: 3.5
    editorPosition: {x: 1560, y: 0}
